PLATINUM PREMIER INTER-COMPANY PROCESSING 
Document: README.IL                        
Version 3.02 rev a
Date: June 15, 1993
==============================

Compatibility
	The Premier Inter-Company Processing version 3.02 rev a requires all 
	interfaced Platinum applications to be version 3.02 or greater. 
	Should any Platinum applications be prior to version 3.02 contact 
	your Platinum dealer or the Platinum Order Department to 
	obtain upgrades to your system. 


PLATINUM PREMIER INTER-COMPANY PROCESSING
Document: README.IL                        
Version 3.02
Date: December 16, 1992
==============================

	This is the general release of the Premier Inter-Company
	module. The Premier General Ledger must be version 3.02 or
	greater to be compatible with this program. 
	
	If your Premier General Ledger is a prior version contact 
	your Platinum dealer or consultant for an upgrade to the 
	correct version. 

Technical Support

	 Technical assistance is available through the Platinum Customer 
	  Solutions Center. The Center may be contacted at 800-333-5242 
	  or 617-329-071.

Forms
	 Platinum compatible forms are available from Altec Products.
	  For ordering information please call 800-333-5180 or 
	  714-727-1248.

Thank you for selecting Platinum as your accounting software. 

	
	
	
	
	This copy of the Platinum Premier Consolidations program is         
	part of the Controlled Release program. The software is functionally
	complete however internal testing has not been completed. 
	
	Some problems may still occur. The problems should be of only of 
	an aesthetic or display variety and not effect processing. 
	
	Please advise us immediately of any processing problems you may 
	encounter. We will then review these issues prior to the General 
	Release of the product. 


Thank you for selecting Platinum as your accounting software. 

